.venv/

# Agent skills are per-developer tooling, installed not committed -- the same
# treatment as .venv above. skills-lock.json IS tracked and pins the exact
# source and content hash of each one, so `npx skills install` reproduces the
# set exactly. Keeping the skill bodies out of the repo also means installing
# a skill is never an act of redistributing someone else's file, whatever
# licence it carries.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
.superpowers/

# Editor lock/swap files
.~lock.*#
*.swp
*~
build-*/
